### =====================================================================
### Day 22: payments and the Idempotency-Key
### Before running: reload the seed, start the app, then Run All.
###   Get-Content .\scripts\dev-seed.sql | docker exec -i appointme-db psql -U appointme -d appointme
### Keys are fixed strings: the seed reload empties idempotency_keys, so the file can run again after a reload.
### =====================================================================

@host = http://localhost:8080

### L1 Alice logs in
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@test.com", "password": "correct-horse-1" }

